    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d233">

                <pb facs="0504" n="484" xml:id="pg484"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 13, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I had yesterday afternoon the honor to
                    receive your note of the same day communicating to me intelligence which you had
                    received from the United States consul general at Montreal, respecting a
                    gathering of enemies of the United States at Windsor, in Canada. I immediately
                    transmitted the intelligence to the governor general at that province.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest consideration, sir, your most obedient,
                    humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS. </signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
